OL,3,ARugby league fans in Wakefield for bus
OL,4,Aparade
OL,5,
OL,6,FFullback Max Jowitt, who has made 188
OL,7,Fappearances for Trinity and scored
OL,8,Fthree goals in the final, said the
OL,9,Fparade had been an "unbelievable"
OL,10,Fexperience.
